# Postgres + Prisma

Follow `backend/AGENTS.md`.

- PostgreSQL 17 in Docker (host port **5433**). App uses `DATABASE_URL`.
- Schema only in `backend/prisma/schema.prisma`. URL in `prisma.config.ts`. Do not add Drizzle or Mongoose.
- Migrations: `prisma migrate dev` locally, `prisma migrate deploy` in prod. Commit `prisma/migrations/`. Gitignore `src/generated/`; run `prisma generate`.
- One `PrismaClient` in `config/db.config.ts` with `PrismaPg` + `DATABASE_URL`. `$connect()` **before** `listen`. `process.exit(1)` on failure.
- PKs: `String @id @default(uuid()) @db.Uuid`. Domain `id` stays `string`.
- Money (when added): `Decimal`, never `Float`. Timestamps: `@db.Timestamptz`.
- Field `passwordHash` (`@map("password_hash")`). Repositories must omit it in `select` except `findUserCredentialsByEmail`.
- `prisma` is imported only from `repositories/`. No `prisma.user` in services or routes.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
await prisma.user.create({ data: { email, passwordHash: plain, name } });

// ✅ GOOD — service hashed first
await prisma.user.create({
  data: { email, passwordHash: input.passwordHash, name: input.name },
  select: { id: true, email: true, name: true, createdAt: true, updatedAt: true },
});
```
